    "markdown": "pandas.Series.cat.codes# Series.cat.codes[source]# Return Series of codes as well as the index. Examples >>> raw_cate = pd.Categorical([\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"a\"], categories=[\"a\", \"b\"]) >>> ser = pd.Series(raw_cate) >>> ser.cat.codes 0 0 1 1 2 -1 3 0 dtype: int8",
